{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0008379 thioredoxin peroxidase activity,\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/32388.\n\nTo be replaced (automatically when possible) by parent GO:0140824 thioredoxin-dependent peroxiredoxin activity\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1akuwuh70GK4S4jsm-3huD5JUgsqcES6RHx5Z45LHHM0\n\nImpacted groups: \nAspGD\t1\nBHF-UCL\t2 - done\nCAFA\t1\nCGD\t2\nComplexPortal\t1\nEcoCyc\t3\nGeneDB\t3\nMGI\t1\nPINC\t1\nParkinsonsUK-UCL\t1 - done\nPomBase\t4\nPseudoCAP\t1\nRGD\t1\nReactome\t3 @deustp01\nSGD\t15 @srengel \nTAIR\t1 @tberardini \nUniProt\t4\nWB\t1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\nGO:0008379\thamap2go\tHAMAP:MF_00269 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379 @pedruzzi \nGO:0008379\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR002065 Thiol peroxidase Tpx > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379 @sarach06 \nGO:0008379\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR037944 Peroxiredoxin-5-like > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\trhea2go\tRHEA:63528 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-3322995 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-3341343 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-3697882 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-3697894 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\nGO:0008379\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR000058574 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379 @PedroRaposo \nGO:0008379\tmetacyc2go\tMetaCyc:RXN0-267 > GO:thioredoxin peroxidase activity ; GO:0008379\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-07-29T17:44:14Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0008379 thioredoxin peroxidase activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T16:58:49Z"}
